WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.880
- Family is very important.

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.010
Like when my daughter,
she's eight years old

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:05.600
right now I'm teaching her
the basic coping mechanisms

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.442
to deal with how she feel inside.

00:00:07.442 --> 00:00:08.275
- [Kelly] Yeah, especially
in the past year-

00:00:08.275 --> 00:00:09.108
- I don't look at my daughter

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:11.130
and talk to my daughter
and say, "What's wrong?"

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:11.963
I don't say that.

00:00:11.963 --> 00:00:13.210
I say, "How you feel?"

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:14.700
I give her an opportunity to tell me

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.273
how she's feeling inside.

00:00:16.273 --> 00:00:17.106
- Yeah.

00:00:17.106 --> 00:00:18.820
- So, 'cause the way she feels is real

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:19.700
and it matters.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.280
- Yeah, and we forget that kids feel,

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:23.113
like, so intensely.
(crowd applause)

00:00:23.113 --> 00:00:25.220
- They know love, they know love.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.053
- Yes.

00:00:26.053 --> 00:00:26.886
- I know love.

00:00:26.886 --> 00:00:28.690
I remember when I was younger.
- Yeah.

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:30.400
- I had no love in my
neighborhood like that.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.290
- Yeah.

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:33.240
- My mother bought me some sneakers,

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.674
some Puma's, and Puma's was hot then.

00:00:35.674 --> 00:00:36.870
(Kelly laughs)
I went to the public pool

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.320
in the neighborhood.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:41.320
And they broke in my locker
and they stole my Puma's.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.020
And I went home and I had a nice meal,

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.780
and I went back the next day like I was

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:46.368
revenging my brother's death.

00:00:46.368 --> 00:00:47.270
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.346
- And I (beep) in the pool.

00:00:49.346 --> 00:00:50.179
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:50.179 --> 00:00:52.360
They shut it down.
- I'll show you.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.223
- 'Cause of bacteria.

00:00:53.223 --> 00:00:54.370
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.760
They shut it 'cause they had
nowhere to play that summer.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:57.650
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:57.650 --> 00:00:59.491
And it was "Do the Right Thing" hot.

00:00:59.491 --> 00:01:00.324
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:00.324 --> 00:01:02.367
I mean, "Do the Right Thing" hot.

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:03.750
And I ain't care, I want my sneakers back.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.810
And ever since I seen that,
ever since that happened,

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:08.201
whenever I see water, it
triggers me to (beep).

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:09.330
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.140
So I was playing in a Johnny Pump

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:12.930
and I (beep) in the street.

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:13.763
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:13.763 --> 00:01:15.073
- And the bus ran over my (beep).

00:01:15.073 --> 00:01:15.906
- My (beep).

00:01:15.906 --> 00:01:17.654
- And then my neighbors
bought a Slip N' Slide it up,

00:01:17.654 --> 00:01:20.058
and I'm (beep) on that
for no apparent reason.

00:01:20.058 --> 00:01:20.891
Just to do it.

00:01:20.891 --> 00:01:22.780
- [Kelly] Just you're a rebel. (laughs)

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:23.790
- Don't play with me.

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:24.623
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:24.623 --> 00:01:25.893
- Took my sneakers.

00:01:26.748 --> 00:01:29.028
- That's the worse.
- I'm not having it.

00:01:29.028 --> 00:01:30.585
- That's the worse though.
- I shut it down.

00:01:30.585 --> 00:01:31.750
- Oh my God.
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:33.570
- Until I get my sneakers back,

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:35.473
these kids ain't playing nowhere.

00:01:35.473 --> 00:01:37.050
(crowd laughs)

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:38.630
- Leave a note by the (beep).

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:40.080
- Leave a note by the (beep).
- Return my sneakers

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.602
and I'll stop.
- That's right.

00:01:41.602 --> 00:01:42.580
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:44.090
- Oh, wait, wait, you're-

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:46.640
- You know my style, y'all know my style.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:48.583
- There is no segue way. I love it.

